@ 10.3.10.2 - Proto-Vanikoro to Tanema
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Ross, Malcolm, and Åshlid Næss (2007), “An Oceanic Origin for Äiwoo, the Language of the Reef Islands?”. Oceanic Linguistics 46(II):456 – 498
	p → v / _#
	pʷ w → b ∅
	t → {∅,t} / #_
	t → s / _u
	r → l / ! _#
	c *R → ∅ {l,∅}
	s → {s,d,c}